msgstr "ویژگی ``isolated`` برای پرچم ``isolated`` در :option:`-I` افزوده شد."

msgid ""
"Added the ``dev_mode`` attribute for the new :ref:`Python Development Mode "
"<devmode>` and the ``utf8_mode`` attribute for the new  :option:`-X` "
